  "supportGuideStep1Title": "Search by coastal zone & live availability",
  "supportGuideStep1Desc": "Select a Vung Tau beach zone (Back Beach, Front Beach, Chi Linh, Long Cung), stay dates [Check-in, Check-out), and group size to filter available private villas.",
  "supportGuideStep2Title": "Review nightly rates & apply promo codes",
  "supportGuideStep2Desc": "Inspect villa specifications (bedrooms, beds, baths, beach distance), weekday/weekend nightly rates, extra-guest surcharges (if any), and apply valid coupon codes.",
  "supportGuideStep3Title": "15-minute temporary calendar hold",
  "supportGuideStep3Desc": "As soon as a booking is created, the system locks your stay dates for 15 minutes (Pending Payment) to prevent double-booking by other groups.",
  "supportGuideStep4Title": "Complete online payment & receive stay confirmation",
  "supportGuideStep4Desc": "Complete payment via supported gateways (VNPay, MoMo, or VietQR) within the hold window. Track booking status and message the Host directly in Trips.",
  "supportCancelFlexName": "Flexible Policy",
  "supportCancelFlexBadge": "100% refund 24h+ before check-in",
  "supportCancelFlexRule1": "Cancel at least 24 hours before check-in: 100% refund of the total paid amount.",
  "supportCancelFlexRule2": "Cancel less than 24 hours before check-in: non-refundable.",
  "supportCancelModName": "Moderate Policy",
  "supportCancelModBadge": "100% refund 5+ days before check-in",
  "supportCancelModRule1": "Cancel at least 5 days (120 hours) before check-in: 100% refund of the total paid amount.",
  "supportCancelModRule2": "Cancel between 24 hours and 5 days (120 hours) before check-in: 50% refund of the total paid amount.",
  "supportCancelModRule3": "Cancel less than 24 hours before check-in: non-refundable.",
  "supportCancelStrictName": "Strict Policy",
  "supportCancelStrictBadge": "50% refund 7+ days before check-in",
  "supportCancelStrictRule1": "Cancel at least 7 days (168 hours) before check-in: 50% refund of the total paid amount.",
  "supportCancelStrictRule2": "Cancel less than 7 days (168 hours) before check-in: non-refundable.",
  "supportComplaintStep1Title": "Submit report with Booking ID or Listing ID",
  "supportComplaintStep1Desc": "Sign in and submit an online report with your Booking ID or Listing ID, describing the factual issue that needs verification.",
  "supportComplaintStep2Title": "Audit stay logs & payment records",
  "supportComplaintStep2Desc": "Our Trust & Safety team independently audits booking state logs, in-app message history, and verified payment records.",
  "supportComplaintStep3Title": "Transparent resolution & guest protection",
  "supportComplaintStep3Desc": "Resolution outcomes are updated transparently on your report (Resolved / Rejected with reason) and trigger refunds if the Host breached commitments.",
  "supportFaqCatAll": "All",
  "supportFaqCatBooking": "Booking & Availability",
  "supportFaqCatPayment": "Payments & Refunds",
  "supportFaqCatAmenities": "Amenities & House Rules",
  "supportFaqCatHost": "Host Partners",
  "supportFaq1Q": "How does the system calculate stay nights?",
  "supportFaq1A": "We use the half-open stay interval [Check-in, Check-out) in Vietnam timezone (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh). Checking in on the 15th and checking out on the 17th equals 2 nights (the 15th and 16th).",
  "supportFaq2Q": "Why does a reservation have a 15-minute hold window?",
  "supportFaq2A": "Each whole-villa listing is a unique property. Creating a reservation locks those dates for 15 minutes so no one else can book them while you pay. Unpaid holds release automatically after 15 minutes.",
  "supportFaq3Q": "How are weekend rates and extra-guest surcharges calculated?",
  "supportFaq3A": "Weekday/weekend nightly rates, cleaning fees, and extra-guest surcharges come directly from each villa’s verified pricing configuration and are shown transparently before booking.",
  "supportFaq4Q": "Which payment methods are supported?",
  "supportFaq4A": "We support online payments via VNPay, MoMo e-wallet, and VietQR bank transfer. Transactions are reconciled automatically and updated in real time under Trips.",
  "supportFaq5Q": "How do refunds work when I cancel within policy or a Host declines?",
  "supportFaq5A": "When a paid booking is cancelled within the villa’s refund window (or cancelled/declined by the Host for a 100% refund), the system automatically creates a refund record for finance reconciliation back to your payment channel.",
  "supportFaq6Q": "Can I chat directly with the Host before booking?",
  "supportFaq6A": "Yes. On any villa detail page, tap Message Host or reach our Zalo OA / Hotline on the Contact page to confirm pool details, BBQ setup, or group bus parking.",
  "supportFaq7Q": "How do I list my villa on The Palm Villa?",
  "supportFaq7A": "Open Become a Host from the navigation menu, complete identity verification (KYC) and property details. Once approved by Admin, you can manage 30-day availability and two-way Google Sheets sync.",
  "supportZoneBaiSauName": "Back Beach Zone (Thuy Van – Thi Sach)",
  "supportZoneBaiSauHint": "Long vibrant coastline within walking distance to the beach",
  "supportZoneBaiSauHighlight": "Features spacious private-pool villas ideal for families and friend groups near Thuy Van, Thi Sach, and Vo Thi Sau streets.",
  "supportZoneBaiTruocName": "Front Beach Zone (Tran Phu – Quang Trung)",
  "supportZoneBaiTruocHint": "Direct ocean sunset views near downtown dining spots",
  "supportZoneBaiTruocHighlight": "Tranquil ocean-facing villas along Tran Phu coastal road with open sunset views and easy access to Front Beach Park.",
  "supportZoneChiLinhName": "Chi Linh Coastal Zone",
  "supportZoneChiLinhHint": "Gated, peaceful resort enclave near quieter beaches",
  "supportZoneChiLinhHighlight": "Well-suited for multi-generational families and corporate retreats seeking greenery, quiet surroundings, and clean beaches.",
  "supportZoneLongCungName": "Long Cung – Thuy Tien Zone",
  "supportZoneLongCungHint": "Beachside villa compounds built for large groups",
  "supportZoneLongCungHighlight": "Known for wide garden villas, private pools, and outdoor BBQ party spaces steps from Long Cung Beach.",
  "supportAddonPoolTitle": "Private in-villa swimming pool",
  "supportAddonPoolDesc": "Enjoy a private swimming pool right inside your villa compound for families and groups.",
  "supportAddonPoolNote": "Included according to each villa’s published specifications.",
  "supportAddonBbqTitle": "Garden BBQ grilling station",
